<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble slipped down to 19,600 per dlr in M.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble slipped down to 19,600 per dlr in M.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 19,600 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 19,100 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 17	  January 16</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    19,600		19,100</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $8.126 million	  $2.763 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
